    "**Interpretation:** Most of the predictive signal comes from clinical and surgical information (anesthesia type, department, ASA class, preoperative labs). Summary vital-sign features add little on top of that. Because the \"wearable\" signals here are derived from intermittent ward vital signs rather than true continuous wearable data, this is a feasibility check, not proof that wearables do or do not help. Continuous, higher-frequency wearable data may capture deterioration patterns that these summaries miss.\n"
